WEBVTT

00:00:00.247 --> 00:00:04.038
A product you won't sell anymore? <b>Delete it</b>

00:00:04.108 --> 00:00:07.592
Find it in Inventario (inventory)

00:00:07.666 --> 00:00:09.774
Tap the trash can

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:14.170
MiCaja asks you to confirm, so nothing is deleted by accident

00:00:14.243 --> 00:00:19.394
It no longer shows at the register, but your past sales keep it
